@* 🟢 شاشة البحث عن فئة الصنف: تُفتح من خانة «اسم الفئة» فى شاشة الصنف (بالضغط على الخانة نفسها بعيداً عن السهم، أو F9).
   قائمة الفئات النشطة مع فلاتر بالاسم والنوع الرئيسى و«تستخدم لـ»؛ اختيار سطر ثم «موافق» (أو ضغط مزدوج / Enter) يُرجع الفئة ويغلق الشاشة.
   التصميم حسب ui-ux-pro-max ونظام inv-* المشترك. *@
@using System.Globalization
@using AccountModelsLib
@using AccountERP.SharedUI.Services
@using static AccountModelsLib.ItemEditorService
@inject LanguageService LangService

<style>
    .cs-filters { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 12px; align-items: start; }
    .cs-list { margin-top: 12px; max-height: 55vh; overflow: auto; border: 1px solid var(--mud-palette-lines-default); border-radius: 10px; }
    .cs-list table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
    .cs-list th { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 1; background: var(--mud-palette-surface); text-align: start; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 600;
                  color: var(--mud-palette-text-secondary); padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mud-palette-lines-default); }
    .cs-list td { padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mud-palette-table-lines, var(--mud-palette-lines-default)); }
    .cs-list tbody tr { cursor: pointer; transition: background-color .15s; }
    .cs-list tbody tr:hover { background: var(--mud-palette-action-default-hover); }
    .cs-list tbody tr.sel { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mud-palette-primary) 16%, transparent); }
    .cs-list tbody tr.sel td:first-child { font-weight: 600; color: var(--mud-palette-primary); }
    .cs-empty { padding: 24px; text-align: center; color: var(--mud-palette-text-secondary); }
    .cs-foot { font-size: .8rem; color: var(--mud-palette-text-secondary); margin-top: 8px; }
    @@media (max-width: 649px) { .cs-filters { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } .cs-list .cs-hide-sm { display: none; } }
    @@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .cs-list tbody tr { transition: none; } }
</style>

<MudDialog Visible="Visible" VisibleChanged="OnMudDialogVisibleChangedAsync"
           Options="@(new DialogOptions { CloseOnEscapeKey = true, FullWidth = true, MaxWidth = MaxWidth.Medium, CloseButton = true, BackdropClick = true })">
    <TitleContent>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.ManageSearch" Color="Color.Primary" />@Tr("CS_Title")</div>
    </TitleContent>
    <DialogContent>
        <div @onkeydown="OnKeyDown" style="@($"direction: {(LangService.IsRtl ? "rtl" : "ltr")};")">
            <div class="cs-filters" role="search" aria-label="@Tr("CS_Title")">
                <MudTextField T="string" Value="_text" ValueChanged="OnTextChanged" Label="@Tr("CS_ByName")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Margin="Margin.Dense"
                              Immediate="true" Clearable="true" AutoFocus="true" Adornment="Adornment.Start" AdornmentIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Search" />
                <MudSelect T="long" Value="_mainId" ValueChanged="OnMainChanged" Label="@Tr("IC_Main")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Margin="Margin.Dense"
                           ToStringFunc="@(id => id == 0 ? Tr("IC_AllMains") : Mains.FirstOrDefault(m => m.Id == id).Name ?? string.Empty)">
                    <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="0L">@Tr("IC_AllMains")</MudSelectItem>
                    @foreach (var m in Mains) { <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="m.Id">@m.Name</MudSelectItem> }
                </MudSelect>
                <MudSelect T="int" Value="_kind" ValueChanged="OnKindChanged" Label="@Tr("IC_Kind")" Variant="Variant.Outlined" Margin="Margin.Dense"
                           ToStringFunc="@(k => KindName(k))">
                    <MudSelectItem T="int" Value="-1">@Tr("IT_KindAll")</MudSelectItem>
                    <MudSelectItem T="int" Value="1">@Tr("IC_Items")</MudSelectItem>
                    <MudSelectItem T="int" Value="2">@Tr("IC_Services")</MudSelectItem>
                </MudSelect>
            </div>

            <div class="cs-list" role="listbox" aria-label="@Tr("IC_AllCats")">
                @if (_rows.Count == 0)
                {
                    <div class="cs-empty">@Tr("CS_NoResults")</div>
                }
                else
                {
                    <table>
                        <thead><tr><th>@Tr("IC_CatName")</th><th>@Tr("IC_Main")</th><th class="cs-hide-sm">@Tr("IC_Kind")</th></tr></thead>
                        <tbody>
                            @foreach (var c in _rows)
                            {
                                var row = c;
                                <tr class="@(row.Id == _selId ? "sel" : null)" role="option" aria-selected="@(row.Id == _selId ? "true" : "false")"
                                    @onclick="@(() => _selId = row.Id)" @ondblclick="@(() => ConfirmAsync(row.Id))">
                                    <td>@row.Name</td>
                                    <td>@row.Main_Name</td>
                                    <td class="cs-hide-sm">@KindName(row.Item_Or_Service)</td>
                                </tr>
                            }
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                }
            </div>
            <div class="cs-foot">@Tr("CS_Count", _rows.Count) · @Tr("CS_KeysHint")</div>
        </div>
    </DialogContent>
    <DialogActions>
        <MudButton OnClick="CloseAsync">@Tr("Cancel")</MudButton>
        <MudButton Color="Color.Primary" Variant="Variant.Filled" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Check" Disabled="@(_selId == 0)" OnClick="@(() => ConfirmAsync(_selId))">@Tr("OkButton")</MudButton>
    </DialogActions>
</MudDialog>

@code {
    [Parameter] public bool Visible { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public EventCallback<bool> VisibleChanged { get; set; }
    /// <summary>الفئات المتاحة (نفس قائمة كومبو الفئة).</summary>
    [Parameter] public List<CategoryOption> Categories { get; set; } = new();
    /// <summary>الفئة المختارة حالياً فى الكومبو — تظهر محددة عند فتح الشاشة.</summary>
    [Parameter] public long SelectedId { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public EventCallback<long> OnSelected { get; set; }

    private string _text = "";
    private long _mainId, _selId;
    private int _kind = -1;
    private bool _wasVisible;
    private List<CategoryOption> _rows = new();

    private IEnumerable<(long Id, string Name)> Mains => Categories.Where(c => c.Main_Id != 0)
        .GroupBy(c => c.Main_Id).Select(g => (g.Key, g.First().Main_Name ?? "")).OrderBy(m => m.Item2);

    protected override void OnParametersSet()
    {
        // كل فتح جديد: فلاتر فارغة والفئة الحالية محددة
        if (Visible && !_wasVisible) { _text = ""; _mainId = 0; _kind = -1; _selId = SelectedId; Filter(); }
        _wasVisible = Visible;
    }

    private void OnTextChanged(string? v) { _text = v ?? ""; Filter(); }
    private void OnMainChanged(long v) { _mainId = v; Filter(); }
    private void OnKindChanged(int v) { _kind = v; Filter(); }

    /// <summary>«تستخدم لـ»: فئة غير محددة (0) تصلح للأصناف والخدمات معاً، كقائمة الإضافة السريعة.</summary>
    private void Filter()
    {
        string t = _text.Trim();
        _rows = Categories.Where(c => (t.Length == 0 || (c.Name ?? "").Contains(t, StringComparison.CurrentCultureIgnoreCase))
                                   && (_mainId == 0 || c.Main_Id == _mainId)
                                   && (_kind < 0 || c.Item_Or_Service == _kind || c.Item_Or_Service == 0)).ToList();
        if (_rows.All(r => r.Id != _selId)) _selId = _rows.Count == 1 ? _rows[0].Id : 0;
    }

    /// <summary>الأسهم تنقل التحديد، وEnter يوافق.</summary>
    private async Task OnKeyDown(KeyboardEventArgs e)
    {
        if (e.Key is "ArrowDown" or "ArrowUp" && _rows.Count > 0)
        {
            int i = _rows.FindIndex(r => r.Id == _selId);
            i = e.Key == "ArrowDown" ? Math.Min(i + 1, _rows.Count - 1) : Math.Max(i - 1, 0);
            _selId = _rows[i].Id;
        }
        else if (e.Key == "Enter" && _selId != 0) await ConfirmAsync(_selId);
    }

    private async Task ConfirmAsync(long id)
    {
        if (id == 0) return;
        await CloseAsync();
        await OnSelected.InvokeAsync(id);
    }

    private string KindName(int k) => k switch { 1 => Tr("IC_Items"), 2 => Tr("IC_Services"), -1 => Tr("IT_KindAll"), _ => Tr("IC_Unspecified") };

    private async Task CloseAsync()
    {
        Visible = false; _wasVisible = false;
        await VisibleChanged.InvokeAsync(false);
    }

    private async Task OnMudDialogVisibleChangedAsync(bool visible)
    {
        Visible = visible; _wasVisible = visible;
        await VisibleChanged.InvokeAsync(visible);
    }

    private string Tr(string key, params object[] args)
    {
        var previousCulture = CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture;
        try { CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture = LangService.CurrentCultureInfo; return Lang[key, args]; }
        finally { CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture = previousCulture; }
    }
}
